{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1087515-how-likely-are-changelings-to-have-changeling-kids","id":1087515,"title":"How likely are Changelings to have Changeling kids?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-03T22:08:57-07:00","id":1087515,"title":"How likely are Changelings to have Changeling kids?","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>c20 p41</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">To avoid a possible conflict of the throne, Lenore remains<br /> heir to Concordia, until the day that David and Faerilyth have<br /> a sidhe child of their own.</div> </div> </div> </div>How likely is that to really come up? And if they have like a Pooka kid instead is he intrinsically denied?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T22:50:38-07:00","id":1087524,"title":"","content":"There's more than one way to have a changeling child. <br /> <br /> Adoption comes to mind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Luka Carroll</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer &amp; Developer<br /> <i>Working On: </i>C20 Player's Guide, Lunars<br /> <i>Worked On: </i>V20 TMR, Demon STG, C20, Book of Freeholds, Conquering Heroes, Building A Legend, Dragon-Blooded, The Realm","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[]